      "local_reason_code": "local_community_projection_authority_planned",
      "judgment_rationale": "The auditable routed module CommunitiesList.tsx is a pure re-export to communities/index.tsx, whose production implementation lists Communities, loads members, starts rebuilds, streams and cancels the active rebuild task, and embeds TaskList.tsx for recent-task listing, retry and stop controls. These imported implementation sources establish the action and API inventory; the routed source-content hash alone is not execution evidence. Desktop has no native communities management route, and Local needs a real community projection rather than a textual search approximation."
